WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

03:45.640 --> 03:46.520
This is…

03:51.160 --> 03:53.840
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

03:53.920 --> 03:55.680
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

03:55.760 --> 03:57.480
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

03:57.560 --> 03:59.480
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

03:59.560 --> 04:02.120
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

04:03.480 --> 04:06.760
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

04:09.880 --> 04:12.640
- My lord.
- My lord.

04:36.240 --> 04:37.360
Follow me.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.120
Follow me.

06:16.040 --> 06:19.080
MOON TRIBE CHIEF, XUNFENG

06:45.640 --> 06:48.840
Welcome back, Moon Supreme.

07:17.080 --> 07:18.080
I…

07:19.440 --> 07:20.360
am back.

07:25.320 --> 07:27.080
Welcome back, my lord!

07:27.880 --> 07:30.480
- Welcome back, my lord!
- Welcome back, my lord!

07:31.160 --> 07:33.600
- Welcome back, my lord!
- Welcome back, my lord!

07:34.160 --> 07:36.760
- Welcome back, my lord!
- Welcome back, my lord!

07:37.520 --> 07:39.720
- Welcome back, my lord!
- Welcome back, my lord!

08:15.040 --> 08:16.920
Is the Four-River Pearl repaired?

08:17.520 --> 08:18.360
Yes.

08:23.120 --> 08:26.000
The resurrection of Dongfang Qingcang
is due to my oversight.

08:26.800 --> 08:28.080
Please forgive me, Lord Yunzhong.

08:30.200 --> 08:32.640
Dongfang Qingcang has been resurrected
for more than ten days,

08:32.720 --> 08:34.600
but he didn't return to Cangyan Sea

08:34.679 --> 08:36.480
and stayed in Yujing instead.

08:36.559 --> 08:37.799
After his identity was exposed,

08:37.880 --> 08:39.880
he kidnapped an unknown fairy.

08:41.600 --> 08:43.280
There must be a reason for this.

08:46.440 --> 08:47.360
Lord Yunzhong.

08:47.440 --> 08:49.160
Please allow me to leave immediately

08:49.240 --> 08:50.240
to kill Dongfang Qingcang

08:50.320 --> 08:51.560
and destroy Cangyan Sea.

08:51.640 --> 08:53.960
As the God of War in Shuiyuntian,

08:54.880 --> 08:56.800
how can you put yourself at risk?

08:58.240 --> 09:01.400
What about your duty
of protecting Shuiyuntian?

09:03.080 --> 09:04.400
Lord Yunzhong, please forgive me.

09:04.480 --> 09:05.760
I'm eager to kill the enemy

09:05.840 --> 09:06.720
and spoke too much.

09:09.200 --> 09:11.440
Are you eager to kill the enemy

09:11.520 --> 09:13.280
or eager to save someone?

09:21.480 --> 09:22.680
Without my order,

09:24.120 --> 09:25.120
you can't do anything.

09:26.360 --> 09:27.200
Yes.

09:32.000 --> 09:37.640
CANGYAN SEA

09:43.240 --> 09:44.680
Black Dragon.

09:44.760 --> 09:46.480
Where are you taking me?

09:47.160 --> 09:48.280
Immortal Devouring Pavilion.

09:49.040 --> 09:50.480
Immortal Devouring Pavilion?

09:50.560 --> 09:51.840
What do you mean by devouring?

09:51.920 --> 09:52.880
Devouring as in eating.

09:55.680 --> 09:56.640
Devour…

09:59.600 --> 10:01.720
Since you know the Moon Supreme so well,

10:01.800 --> 10:03.920
do you know what he likes to eat?

10:04.000 --> 10:06.920
What Dongfang Qingcang likes to eat most

10:07.000 --> 10:09.360
are fair and chubby little fairies

10:09.920 --> 10:12.160
with thin skin and tender meat like you.

10:12.240 --> 10:13.800
Boiled,

10:13.880 --> 10:15.120
roasted,

10:15.200 --> 10:16.720
raw.

10:26.040 --> 10:27.920
Little Flower Spirit, let's go.

10:31.280 --> 10:34.160
People in Moon Tribe are so unreasonable.

10:34.240 --> 10:36.840
If I didn't accidentally break
into the Haotian Tower,

10:36.920 --> 10:38.000
your Moon Supreme

10:38.080 --> 10:39.840
would be locked up for 30,000…

10:39.920 --> 10:41.760
No, 300,000 years.

10:41.840 --> 10:43.840
Not only did you not thank me,

10:43.920 --> 10:45.880
but you even want to eat me.

10:45.960 --> 10:48.280
Do you have any humanity in you?

10:50.520 --> 10:53.240
My lord accidentally fell
into Fairy Realm's trick.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.280
That was why he was trapped.

10:55.280 --> 10:56.760
How can a lowly fairy

10:56.840 --> 10:59.000
be the savior of my lord?

10:59.640 --> 11:01.960
Besides, when did my lord say
that he wants to eat you?

11:02.680 --> 11:04.760
Isn't the Immortal Devouring Pavilion

11:04.840 --> 11:06.480
used for eating fairies?

11:10.400 --> 11:12.440
The Immortal Devouring Pavilion
is just an ordinary bedroom.

11:13.520 --> 11:15.680
Silent Moon Palace has a place
called Immortal Slaying Pavilion.

11:15.760 --> 11:17.600
There's also Divine Slayer Ward.

11:18.320 --> 11:20.280
They were all established
by the late Moon Supreme.

11:21.240 --> 11:24.600
It has an auspicious meaning
of destroying Shuiyuntian one day.

11:24.680 --> 11:25.520
Really?

11:26.120 --> 11:27.400
You're not lying to me, are you?

11:27.480 --> 11:28.760
I never lie.

11:50.160 --> 11:51.080
My lord.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.000
You may leave.

11:54.080 --> 11:55.160
- Yes.
- Yes.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.080
My lord.

12:08.840 --> 12:10.920
Orchid is already in her bedroom.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.600
Are the doctors ready?

12:12.680 --> 12:13.920
My lord, don't worry.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.000
Everything has been arranged.

12:15.680 --> 12:17.280
After studying it carefully,

12:17.880 --> 12:21.120
I found out that the Xilan Holy Seal
really has a way to break it.

12:22.520 --> 12:24.160
If I want to break the curse,

12:24.240 --> 12:27.920
we can only kill one of them

12:28.000 --> 12:29.800
with the ancient weapon, Chengying Sword.

12:29.880 --> 12:30.920
Congratulations, my lord.

12:34.440 --> 12:37.840
The Xilan Book was written
tens of thousands of years ago.

12:38.400 --> 12:39.880
The Chengying Sword

12:39.960 --> 12:42.200
was already destroyed in the ancient war.

12:42.280 --> 12:44.720
Even its fragments
are already scattered everywhere.

12:44.800 --> 12:46.480
My lord, you may not be aware.

12:46.560 --> 12:48.360
Although the Chengying Sword
was destroyed,

12:48.440 --> 12:50.040
its fragments are still traceable.

12:50.600 --> 12:52.920
It is said that there is a piece
under Silver Lake.

12:53.480 --> 12:55.080
I'll go and find it now.

12:57.920 --> 13:00.040
So this is what the fairies
from Shuiyuntian look like.

13:00.120 --> 13:02.520
Why does she look different
from the ones in the book?

13:02.600 --> 13:05.240
Her appearance is just average.

13:05.320 --> 13:06.360
Yes.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.040
Stop.

13:08.120 --> 13:10.080
Stop touching me.

13:10.160 --> 13:11.760
Who are you?

13:11.840 --> 13:13.240
Why did my lord bring you

13:13.320 --> 13:15.200
from Shuiyuntian?

13:16.760 --> 13:18.040
How would I know?

13:18.840 --> 13:21.040
Could it be that our lord

13:21.120 --> 13:22.040
likes her?

13:23.440 --> 13:24.520
- He likes her?
- Look at her.

13:24.600 --> 13:26.040
Her face is just ordinary.

13:26.120 --> 13:28.480
- No way.
- Her powers are obviously not good.

13:28.560 --> 13:31.040
How can our lord like her?

13:31.120 --> 13:31.960
Exactly.

13:32.040 --> 13:34.040
Forget that I was mocked in Shuiyuntian.

13:34.640 --> 13:36.080
Why am I still being criticized

13:36.160 --> 13:38.000
in Cangyan Sea?

13:38.080 --> 13:40.120
If our lord didn't like her,

13:40.200 --> 13:42.560
why did he specifically order us
to heal her

13:42.640 --> 13:43.840
when he's busy taking over

13:43.920 --> 13:46.360
the affairs of the Moon Tribe?

13:47.480 --> 13:48.440
Look.

13:48.520 --> 13:51.640
These are the best elixirs
in Silent Moon Palace.

13:52.200 --> 13:53.560
They are never given to outsiders.

13:55.920 --> 13:57.320
I asked you to heal her.

13:57.400 --> 13:58.600
What are you doing?

14:00.160 --> 14:01.800
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

14:02.800 --> 14:03.800
Leave us.

14:03.880 --> 14:04.760
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:19.880 --> 14:20.840
Little Flower Spirit.

14:21.440 --> 14:22.360
What?

14:22.440 --> 14:24.760
Didn't you act very arrogantly
toward me before?

14:24.840 --> 14:26.160
Are you afraid of me now?

14:27.240 --> 14:29.680
My lord, I was wrong.

14:31.880 --> 14:32.720
No.

14:40.360 --> 14:41.360
I want you

14:42.000 --> 14:43.920
to treat me like you used to.

14:45.360 --> 14:46.280
No.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.800
It was my fault before.

14:47.880 --> 14:49.120
I won't do it again.

14:55.800 --> 14:56.640
However,

14:59.000 --> 15:00.320
even if you're the Moon Supreme,

15:00.400 --> 15:01.320
I have to say this.

15:01.400 --> 15:02.920
Even if you took me away,

15:03.000 --> 15:04.800
you can't take away my heart.

15:04.880 --> 15:06.400
I won't like you.

15:06.480 --> 15:07.440
Why?

15:07.520 --> 15:08.800
No reason.

15:08.880 --> 15:11.080
Because I already like someone else.

15:14.600 --> 15:16.200
Changheng again?

15:16.280 --> 15:17.320
Aside from mentioning him,

15:17.400 --> 15:18.680
can you say anything else?

15:20.200 --> 15:21.120
Not really.

15:22.000 --> 15:22.840
Anyway,

15:23.400 --> 15:25.160
it's useless

15:25.240 --> 15:26.520
even if you're in love with me.

15:26.600 --> 15:28.080
You can't force me.

15:28.160 --> 15:29.000
How ridiculous.

15:30.160 --> 15:31.520
Why would I fall for you?

15:33.960 --> 15:35.880
In that case,

15:35.960 --> 15:37.320
Moon Supreme Lord,

15:37.400 --> 15:39.520
why don't you just let me go?

15:39.600 --> 15:40.640
Let you go?

15:40.720 --> 15:42.000
Where can you go?

15:42.680 --> 15:43.800
Don't forget.

15:43.880 --> 15:46.280
You are a fugitive from Shuiyuntian

15:46.360 --> 15:48.720
and a spy for the Moon Tribe.

15:49.280 --> 15:50.920
There's no place for you elsewhere.

15:51.000 --> 15:52.800
That's because you lied to me.

15:52.880 --> 15:54.000
I never lied to you.

15:54.080 --> 15:55.360
You're just too stupid.

15:56.240 --> 15:57.080
You…

15:58.720 --> 15:59.680
Don't forget.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.320
I took you away from Shuiyuntian

16:02.400 --> 16:04.240
in front of everyone.

16:04.320 --> 16:05.840
I'm afraid

16:05.920 --> 16:08.080
you'll never be cleared of that honor.

16:08.160 --> 16:09.800
From now on,

16:09.880 --> 16:11.520
you will be with me.

16:11.600 --> 16:12.640
Understand?

16:24.960 --> 16:26.360
Fix the Destiny Book

16:26.440 --> 16:28.400
or you won't get out of this room.

16:32.600 --> 16:34.240
This Destiny Book again?

16:34.320 --> 16:35.800
You are the Moon Supreme.

16:35.880 --> 16:38.040
Why are you holding
onto a mortal's Destiny Book?

16:38.120 --> 16:39.120
What are you going to do?

16:39.200 --> 16:40.080
Stop asking.

16:40.160 --> 16:41.040
Just fix it.

16:48.600 --> 16:50.320
I won't fix this Destiny Book.

16:50.400 --> 16:52.120
I won't hold that candle to the evil.

17:06.359 --> 17:07.200
My lord.

17:07.280 --> 17:08.920
Lord Xunfeng requests to see you.

17:09.000 --> 17:10.720
He said he wants to return
Cangyan Sea's sacred artifact,

17:10.800 --> 17:11.680
the You Jade Ring.

17:12.359 --> 17:14.240
He's already outside the hall.

17:24.200 --> 17:25.400
Let him in.

17:25.480 --> 17:29.440
SILENT MOON PALACE MAIN HALL,
CANGYAN SEA

17:33.240 --> 17:36.080
MOON TRIBE CHIEF, XUNFENG

17:42.240 --> 17:43.520
Greetings, my lord.

17:45.640 --> 17:46.480
Wait.

17:50.000 --> 17:51.360
Let him give it to me himself.

17:52.400 --> 17:53.280
Yes.

18:30.320 --> 18:31.560
What's the matter?

18:32.400 --> 18:33.800
Are you afraid that I'll kill you?

18:37.040 --> 18:39.600
You're my brother.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.720
For someone who killed his father

18:41.800 --> 18:43.680
for the position of Moon Supreme,

18:44.880 --> 18:46.960
why would he show mercy

18:47.040 --> 18:48.320
to his brother?

18:49.760 --> 18:51.440
While I wasn't here,

18:51.520 --> 18:52.960
Cangyan Sea had no leader.

18:53.800 --> 18:55.400
You became the acting Moon Supreme.

18:55.880 --> 18:57.040
It's not considered a seizure of power.

18:57.120 --> 19:00.680
I want to ask you this
on behalf of the people of Cangyan Sea.

19:01.320 --> 19:02.320
Thirty thousand years ago,

19:02.400 --> 19:04.720
since you weren't killed
by the Fairy Realm,

19:04.800 --> 19:07.280
why didn't you come back here
to take charge of the situation?

19:08.680 --> 19:10.400
As the Moon Supreme,

19:10.480 --> 19:13.160
why did you sit idly even when you knew

19:13.240 --> 19:14.840
that there was civil unrest here?

19:17.960 --> 19:20.000
Do you want to interfere in my affairs?

19:20.760 --> 19:22.000
I dare not.

19:24.400 --> 19:27.520
I would like you to resolve my confusion

19:28.720 --> 19:31.600
and give an explanation
to the people of Cangyan Sea.

19:32.560 --> 19:33.760
Why should I explain to you

19:34.360 --> 19:36.120
what I'm doing?

19:38.880 --> 19:41.160
I hope what you're doing

19:43.680 --> 19:45.880
is worthy of the sacred artifact
of the Moon Tribe.

20:04.440 --> 20:05.440
I'll get going.

20:19.560 --> 20:20.400
My lord.

20:21.760 --> 20:23.640
Lord Xunfeng is so rude.

20:25.160 --> 20:26.680
Could he be disloyal?

20:29.920 --> 20:31.120
It's nothing.

20:31.680 --> 20:33.840
He just wants to kill me.

20:34.680 --> 20:35.520
My lord.

20:37.240 --> 20:40.360
I killed his beloved father.

20:40.440 --> 20:42.320
It's not hard to guess
that he wants to kill me.

20:43.640 --> 20:45.040
But with his capability?

20:48.160 --> 20:51.360
Besides, he hadn't made
any big mistakes yet.

20:51.440 --> 20:53.240
It's still useful to keep him alive.

20:53.320 --> 20:54.560
We can kill him

20:55.560 --> 20:56.600
after he makes a mistake.

20:57.080 --> 20:58.040
Yes.

21:02.520 --> 21:03.360
My lord.

21:04.840 --> 21:06.800
The sacred artifact
has returned to you now.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.560
After wearing it,

21:09.320 --> 21:12.120
even if it can't isolate the curse's
conjoined damage with Orchid,

21:12.200 --> 21:13.560
she can't affect your mood anymore.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.480
By the way,

21:16.480 --> 21:18.520
is Little Flower Spirit still refusing
to fix the Destiny Book?

21:19.440 --> 21:20.280
Yes.

21:20.840 --> 21:21.880
These days,

21:21.960 --> 21:23.960
she keeps saying she wants
to return to Shuiyuntian.

21:24.480 --> 21:26.040
Now, she even refuses to apply medicine.

21:26.120 --> 21:27.000
That's ridiculous!

21:27.080 --> 21:28.520
How can she recover
without applying the medicine?

21:36.000 --> 21:37.080
If she doesn't recover,

21:38.200 --> 21:39.680
how can she fix the Destiny Book?

21:41.080 --> 21:41.920
Yes.

21:42.600 --> 21:43.920
But I think

21:44.000 --> 21:45.200
the wounds are not a big deal.

21:45.880 --> 21:47.480
I'm afraid that if she's in a bad mood,

21:47.560 --> 21:48.800
it will exhaust her power.

21:50.200 --> 21:51.960
I'm afraid fixing the Destiny Book is…

21:52.040 --> 21:53.360
What should we do then?

21:55.560 --> 21:56.560
My lord, don't worry.

21:57.440 --> 21:59.440
Little Flower Spirit
is as timid as a mouse.

21:59.520 --> 22:00.920
And it's her first time traveling.

22:01.760 --> 22:03.400
That's why she's nervous.

22:09.600 --> 22:10.800
Her first time

22:11.760 --> 22:13.320
traveling?

22:19.600 --> 22:22.040
Find the best carpenter
in Silent Moon Palace.

22:24.880 --> 22:25.720
Yes.

22:35.000 --> 22:36.280
I didn't expect

22:37.080 --> 22:38.360
that amidst my schemes,

22:39.200 --> 22:40.880
I still failed in the end.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.440
My lord.

22:42.520 --> 22:44.240
Then the late Goddess of War's
Destiny Book…

22:44.320 --> 22:47.200
I've already searched Arbiter Hall.

22:48.040 --> 22:50.280
My master's book is not there.

22:51.200 --> 22:52.880
Dongfang Qingcang stayed with the fairy

22:52.960 --> 22:55.120
in Arbiter Hall for the past few days.

22:56.480 --> 22:59.040
Could he have already read
the Destiny Book?

23:01.680 --> 23:03.680
That's what I'm worried about.

23:06.160 --> 23:07.760
During the Battle of Two Tribes,

23:08.520 --> 23:10.520
my master was hurt by his Hellfire.

23:11.560 --> 23:12.760
Scars from Hellfire

23:13.320 --> 23:15.560
will never disappear
no matter how many times they reincarnate.

23:16.200 --> 23:18.680
If Dongfang Qingcang
saw the scars of Hellfire

23:18.760 --> 23:20.760
on Red Spirit's body
through the Destiny Book,

23:22.160 --> 23:23.960
he can confirm that she is my master.

23:24.440 --> 23:25.520
If Dongfang Qingcang knows

23:25.600 --> 23:27.680
that the primordial spirit
of the late Goddess of War is still here,

23:27.760 --> 23:29.560
he will surely try
to retrieve her primordial spirit

23:29.640 --> 23:30.960
and pour it into the Shuofeng Sword

23:31.040 --> 23:32.360
to initiate the 100,000 soldiers.

23:32.440 --> 23:35.440
Then the late Goddess of War's soul
will surely dissipate.

23:36.200 --> 23:38.480
Then wouldn't your 30,000 years
of hard work be…

23:38.560 --> 23:40.760
I did everything I could

23:40.840 --> 23:42.680
to keep a piece
of Master's primordial spirit.

23:43.240 --> 23:45.080
I will never allow anyone

23:45.160 --> 23:47.400
to disrupt Master's revival plan.

23:56.840 --> 23:58.680
Contact the spies of Silent Moon Palace

23:58.760 --> 24:00.480
to confirm if Dongfang Qingcang knows

24:00.560 --> 24:02.160
the existence of the Destiny Book.

24:02.720 --> 24:04.680
Upon confirmation,

24:04.760 --> 24:06.840
we will plan how to snatch the goddess.

24:07.960 --> 24:08.800
Yes.

24:12.880 --> 24:17.680
SILENT MOON PALACE, CANGYAN SEA

24:31.640 --> 24:32.880
Flower sisters.

24:32.960 --> 24:34.360
I'm begging you.

24:34.440 --> 24:36.040
I know you are Cangyan Sea's flowers.

24:36.120 --> 24:37.360
You don't know me well.

24:37.440 --> 24:39.480
But since we're all flowers,

24:39.560 --> 24:41.120
please help me this time.

24:41.200 --> 24:42.440
Give me some pollen

24:42.520 --> 24:44.360
to make those two guys
by the door unconscious.

24:44.960 --> 24:46.000
I swear,

24:46.080 --> 24:47.440
after I return to Arbiter Hall,

24:47.520 --> 24:49.120
I will make a tablet for you

24:49.200 --> 24:50.520
and give you offerings.

24:50.600 --> 24:51.920
I'm begging you.

25:30.000 --> 25:30.840
Sir.

25:48.840 --> 25:50.160
Empty moves.

25:50.880 --> 25:52.360
Even if you can get out of this door,

25:52.440 --> 25:54.600
there are countless guards outside.

25:54.680 --> 25:56.320
You can't get out of Silent Moon Palace.

25:59.240 --> 26:00.080
Follow me.

26:00.640 --> 26:02.120
My lord wants to take you to a place.

26:06.880 --> 26:07.760
Hurry up.

26:21.200 --> 26:22.080
Go.

26:39.920 --> 26:42.400
I heard you wanted to run away.

26:44.360 --> 26:45.560
No.

26:45.640 --> 26:46.800
It's fine.

26:46.880 --> 26:48.360
After you move in,

26:48.440 --> 26:50.080
you won't want to run away anymore.

26:55.560 --> 26:58.040
Moon Supreme Lord,
I won't run around again.

26:58.120 --> 26:59.840
Don't lock me up in prison.

26:59.920 --> 27:00.920
I'm afraid of the dark.

27:01.000 --> 27:02.840
If you lock me up in prison,

27:02.920 --> 27:04.560
I'll go crazy.

27:16.240 --> 27:17.080
Follow me.

27:37.920 --> 27:39.360
Why is it so dark here?

27:39.440 --> 27:40.920
I can't see anything.

27:42.520 --> 27:44.400
Is this not a prison,

27:44.480 --> 27:45.720
but a dungeon?

27:45.800 --> 27:46.960
Take a guess.

27:49.280 --> 27:50.480
Moon Supreme Lord,

27:50.560 --> 27:52.280
be magnanimous.

27:52.360 --> 27:54.000
Don't lower yourself to my level.

27:54.080 --> 27:56.520
I promise I won't run away again.

27:56.600 --> 27:59.400
Please. Send me back
to the Immortal Devouring Pavilion.

27:59.480 --> 28:00.400
Are you scared now?

28:00.480 --> 28:01.800
It's too late.

28:02.480 --> 28:04.240
You'll have to live here from now on.

28:07.800 --> 28:08.640
Follow me!

28:25.360 --> 28:26.560
What is this place?

28:27.240 --> 28:28.560
Why is it so dark?

28:28.640 --> 28:30.000
Where are you taking me?

29:25.480 --> 29:26.320
This place is…

29:26.800 --> 29:28.000
It is…

29:41.280 --> 29:43.480
It's my small platform.

29:45.600 --> 29:46.560
Also…

29:50.400 --> 29:52.760
It's really my fate tree.

29:53.240 --> 29:56.280
Fate tree, I missed you so much.

30:03.600 --> 30:04.440
Daqiang.

30:04.520 --> 30:05.760
No, Big Blockhead.

30:05.840 --> 30:07.240
Is this Arbiter Hall?

30:16.640 --> 30:18.400
Creeper, Peach!

30:18.480 --> 30:19.960
I'm here!

30:56.760 --> 30:57.800
This is great.

30:57.880 --> 31:00.040
There's no place like home.

31:00.120 --> 31:01.680
I'm finally home.

31:02.200 --> 31:03.760
From now on, you can see

31:03.840 --> 31:05.600
such sunrises and sunsets every day.

31:05.680 --> 31:08.120
You don't have to go
to Yunzhong Water Pavilion's roof anymore.

31:10.360 --> 31:11.280
Do you like it?

31:12.880 --> 31:15.040
I specially built it for you.

31:16.240 --> 31:18.440
All the houses, structures,

31:18.520 --> 31:19.640
and every brick and tile

31:19.720 --> 31:22.360
are exactly the same
as Arbiter Hall in Shuiyuntian.

31:22.440 --> 31:25.600
I thought you might miss home
because it's your first time traveling.

31:25.680 --> 31:27.280
You can live here in the future.

31:28.760 --> 31:30.440
This is not Shuiyuntian?

31:31.680 --> 31:32.920
This is Cangyan Sea.

31:35.920 --> 31:37.080
That's impossible.

31:37.160 --> 31:39.320
This place looks exactly like Shuiyuntian.

31:39.400 --> 31:41.080
How can it not be Shuiyuntian?

31:43.280 --> 31:45.960
Creeper, Holly, Peach.

31:46.040 --> 31:47.080
Come out.

31:52.800 --> 31:53.640
You…

31:54.800 --> 31:55.960
don't like it?

32:04.160 --> 32:05.120
I like it.

32:05.960 --> 32:07.560
Thank you, Moon Supreme Lord.

32:09.520 --> 32:10.400
Are you unhappy?

32:15.320 --> 32:16.400
Tell me the truth.

32:17.720 --> 32:18.880
Although…

32:20.200 --> 32:22.440
Although it is very similar
to Arbiter Hall…

32:22.520 --> 32:23.640
Isn't it good

32:24.520 --> 32:25.680
for them to be similar?

32:29.200 --> 32:31.080
Arbiter Hall is so remote.

32:32.600 --> 32:35.120
I can't see such beautiful sunrises.

32:35.800 --> 32:37.520
And these flowers and plants

32:38.200 --> 32:40.400
are not my pets.

32:41.560 --> 32:43.080
When I talk to them,

32:43.960 --> 32:45.640
they won't answer me.

32:46.160 --> 32:47.520
What are you trying to say?

32:51.760 --> 32:53.560
I want to go back to my real home.

32:53.640 --> 32:54.960
I told you.

32:55.040 --> 32:56.240
This is your home.

32:56.320 --> 32:58.160
From now on,
you're not allowed to go anywhere.

33:00.400 --> 33:02.160
I'm begging you, Moon Supreme Lord.

33:02.240 --> 33:03.960
I helped you hide

33:04.040 --> 33:05.480
in Shuiyuntian before.

33:06.000 --> 33:08.440
And I let you stay in Arbiter Hall
for so long.

33:08.520 --> 33:10.680
I treated you well, didn't I?

33:11.680 --> 33:14.360
But if you knew
that I was Dongfang Qingcang,

33:15.280 --> 33:16.560
would you still help me?

33:50.000 --> 33:51.280
Regardless,

33:52.600 --> 33:54.640
we've been together for so long.

33:55.360 --> 33:58.080
I will remember this friendship forever.

33:58.840 --> 34:00.440
Even if I return to Shuiyuntian,

34:00.520 --> 34:04.000
I will never tell anyone where you are.

34:05.200 --> 34:06.560
Even if Lord Changheng asks me--

34:06.640 --> 34:08.520
You always talk about Changheng.

34:08.600 --> 34:10.560
What else do you think about
aside from Changheng?

34:12.239 --> 34:13.840
I won't talk about him anymore.

34:14.560 --> 34:15.560
Please.

34:15.639 --> 34:16.719
Let me go back.

34:16.800 --> 34:18.560
You still want to leave!

34:19.320 --> 34:20.280
No matter what you want,

34:20.360 --> 34:22.880
I can find it for you in the three realms.

34:22.960 --> 34:25.960
Aside from you,
I never indulged anyone like this.

34:26.040 --> 34:27.400
Why do you still want to leave?

34:37.400 --> 34:38.239
Why?

35:02.120 --> 35:03.200
Little Flower Spirit.

35:04.040 --> 35:05.440
Let me tell you the truth.

35:06.440 --> 35:09.200
There is no love between you and me.

35:09.760 --> 35:11.400
When we were in Arbiter Hall,

35:11.480 --> 35:13.800
I only tolerated you

35:13.880 --> 35:16.080
because of the One Heart Curse.

35:18.640 --> 35:19.960
One Heart Curse?

35:20.040 --> 35:23.400
This damn curse
made me share your joy and sorrow.

35:23.480 --> 35:25.440
That's why I had to keep protecting

35:25.520 --> 35:28.120
and taking care of you.

35:28.880 --> 35:29.720
But now,

35:33.200 --> 35:34.960
I have the You Jade Ring.

35:35.040 --> 35:36.600
It can isolate emotions.

35:37.680 --> 35:39.400
And I've captured you now.

35:40.200 --> 35:41.600
I can finally

35:41.680 --> 35:43.720
get rid of the weakness.

35:57.480 --> 35:58.560
So…

35:59.480 --> 36:00.760
all your kindness to me

36:01.760 --> 36:02.960
was fake?

36:08.400 --> 36:10.040
You let me get some sun.

36:10.880 --> 36:12.400
You caught the morning dew for me.

36:13.800 --> 36:15.280
And you made me flower soup.

36:17.200 --> 36:18.640
Was it all fake?

36:18.720 --> 36:19.600
Yes.

36:20.560 --> 36:21.960
Not only was it all fake,

36:22.600 --> 36:25.560
but doing these things was also

36:26.120 --> 36:27.200
very disgusting for me.

37:01.080 --> 37:02.120
Keep an eye on her.

37:02.200 --> 37:03.080
Without my order,

37:03.160 --> 37:04.400
she can't leave this place.

37:04.480 --> 37:05.600
Yes.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.160
Also,

37:08.680 --> 37:11.840
find the Chengying Sword fragment
under Silver Lake.

37:14.680 --> 37:16.400
I want to remake the Chengying Sword.

37:16.880 --> 37:17.920
Yes, my lord.

38:08.000 --> 38:08.960
Dongfang Qingcang!

38:09.040 --> 38:10.880
How long are you going to lock me up?

38:10.960 --> 38:12.920
What kind of weather is this every day?

38:13.000 --> 38:14.720
There's always thunder, wind,
and rain here.

38:14.800 --> 38:16.680
It's so cold that I can't sleep!

38:16.760 --> 38:17.920
There's no sun

38:18.000 --> 38:19.760
and no one to talk to!

38:30.560 --> 38:31.800
Moon Supreme Lord!

38:31.880 --> 38:33.080
Dongfang Qingcang!

38:33.160 --> 38:35.120
You're ungrateful.

38:35.680 --> 38:36.840
You're bullying me like this.

38:36.920 --> 38:39.040
Aren't you afraid
of being laughed at by others?

38:39.120 --> 38:40.440
Dongfang Qingcang!

38:40.520 --> 38:45.400
Come out!

39:18.240 --> 39:19.600
How is the little flower spirit?

39:19.680 --> 39:20.720
Has she surrendered?

39:21.200 --> 39:22.040
Not yet.

39:22.600 --> 39:24.240
She shouts in the garden every day

39:24.720 --> 39:26.000
and scolds you.

39:28.400 --> 39:31.040
But she didn't do anything
in the past few days.

39:31.960 --> 39:33.000
But they said

39:33.080 --> 39:34.760
she started a hunger strike again.

39:34.840 --> 39:35.920
She wouldn't eat anything.

39:37.000 --> 39:38.360
She wouldn't eat anything?

39:39.240 --> 39:40.360
Good.

39:40.440 --> 39:42.200
She's gluttonous.

39:42.280 --> 39:43.920
It seems like she will surrender soon.

39:47.920 --> 39:50.400
My lord, the fairy you brought back is…

39:52.520 --> 39:53.400
What's wrong with her?

39:54.440 --> 39:55.440
She's on a hunger strike

39:55.520 --> 39:56.800
and she stood in the cold wind.

39:56.880 --> 39:57.800
She's dying.

39:59.040 --> 40:00.480
Why didn't you find a doctor?

40:01.000 --> 40:03.160
He already went there,
but she refused to get treated.

40:03.240 --> 40:04.880
And she said she won't live long.

40:04.960 --> 40:07.400
She has something very important
that she'll only tell you.

40:13.840 --> 40:16.040
Why do you refuse to eat?
Why did you let yourself freeze?

40:16.120 --> 40:17.400
Why did you kick the doctor out?

40:17.480 --> 40:18.600
Do you want to die?

40:23.680 --> 40:25.200
Moon Supreme Lord.

40:25.960 --> 40:27.920
I seem to be sick.

40:40.880 --> 40:41.760
Listen.

40:42.320 --> 40:44.000
I don't care about you.

40:44.560 --> 40:46.080
But your life belongs to me.

40:46.160 --> 40:48.240
So before you fix the Destiny Book,

40:48.320 --> 40:49.760
you'd better take care of yourself.

40:49.840 --> 40:50.800
Got it?

40:51.920 --> 40:53.120
Yes.

40:56.400 --> 40:58.760
What important things must you tell me?

40:58.840 --> 40:59.720
Go ahead.

41:12.360 --> 41:13.720
Moon Supreme Lord.

41:14.680 --> 41:16.560
Can we talk outside?

41:17.960 --> 41:18.920
Let's talk here.

41:20.320 --> 41:21.240
No.

41:21.320 --> 41:23.280
I can't say it here.

41:44.560 --> 41:45.400
Stop.

41:46.560 --> 41:48.080
Do you still want to freeze here?

41:48.160 --> 41:49.080
Just say it here.

41:53.480 --> 41:56.000
I have no time to waste with you. Tell me.

41:57.960 --> 41:59.080
I just…

42:03.520 --> 42:04.440
Speak louder.

42:04.520 --> 42:05.520
I can't hear you.

42:08.520 --> 42:09.760
What are you trying to say?
